   "evidence": "wire",
   "value": {
    "text": "For your two days in Barcelona, expect rain on Day 1 with a high of 21°C, then sunny weather on Day 2 with a high of 22°C. Pack a compact, lightweight waterproof jacket or travel umbrella and water-resistant shoes for the rainy first day. Bring breathable layers for both days: t-shirts, a light long-sleeve top, and a thin sweater or cardigan for cooler mornings and evenings. Add comfortable walking shoes or sneakers, plus a pair of light pants or jeans. For the sunny second day, bring sunglasses, a hat, and sunscreen. A small daypack will hold your rain gear and sun protection, and a reusable water bottle will keep you hydrated while you explore. Finally, bring a phone charger and a portable battery for long days of sightseeing."
